Subject: mt6768: sweetmali= Mali-G52 bring-up from XNU (clock, power domains, reset, cores, two jobs)

diff --git a/bsd/conf/files b/bsd/conf/files
index 1671067..ff3466d 100644
--- a/bsd/conf/files
